Third-party material used by the developer tooling of this repository.

The Swift package dependencies (swift-subprocess, swift-argument-parser and their dependency swift-system) are not
vendored; they are fetched by SwiftPM at the exact versions pinned in Package.swift and Package.resolved, and ship
under their own licenses (Apache License 2.0 with Runtime Library Exception).

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
aemi (Plugins/CheckPlugin, Plugins/AnalyzersPlugin, Plugins/BuildAppPlugin)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The three command plugins follow the structure of the command plugins in the aemi package (Plugins/Lint and
Plugins/Format): the tool is resolved with `context.tool(named:)`, started with `Process`, and a non-zero status is
thrown so that `swift package` exits non-zero. The files carry a header comment naming the origin.

